@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
@cartId = 1
@userId = 2

### List carts
GET {{baseUrl}}/carts

### Filter carts by user
GET {{baseUrl}}/carts?userId={{userId}}

### Get one cart
GET {{baseUrl}}/carts/{{cartId}}

### Create a cart
POST {{baseUrl}}/carts
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": 2
}

### Update a cart's user
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/carts/{{cartId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": 2
}

### Delete a cart
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/carts/{{cartId}}
